T*
(1. Scope and time) Tj
T*
(Business key is \(vendor_id, invoice_id\), never invoice_id alone.) Tj
T*
(For EVERY ledger, use a record only when BOTH event_on <= event cutoff AND) Tj
T*
(recorded_on <= recorded cutoff \(index page 1\). Ignore other records completely.) Tj
T*
(Select greatest numeric revision per invoice business key AFTER time filtering.) Tj
T*
(Then check its status; never revert to an older POSTED revision if latest is VOID/DRAFT.) Tj
T*
(Equal copies of the same revision/entry count once; conflicting copies are invalid data.) Tj
T*
(PO versions group by \(vendor_id,po_id\); receipt versions by receipt_id; settlement) Tj
T*
(versions by \(vendor_id,entry_id\). Select greatest revision before status checks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Evaluate ALL gates, without short-circuiting on an earlier failure) Tj
T*
(NOT_POSTED: the selected invoice status is anything other than POSTED.) Tj
T*
(DUPLICATE: a latest eligible DUPLICATE_AUDIT for that business key is CONFIRMED.) Tj
T*
(NO_BALANCE: gross minus POSTED CREDIT minus SETTLED PAYMENT is <= 0.) Tj
T*
(Only settlement entries matching BOTH vendor_id and invoice_id may be applied.) Tj
T*
(All amounts include tax, in SGD. Round the final net to cents, half up.) Tj
T*
(net_payable_sgd is this book balance, including on HOLD rows; do not zero it for HOLD.) Tj
T*
(PO_MISMATCH: no matching selected APPROVED PO, or invoice gross exceeds its amount.) Tj
T*
(RECEIPT_SHORT: total selected ACCEPTED receipt amounts for this vendor/invoice/PO) Tj
T*
(is less than invoice gross. Exact cents; no percentage tolerance or cross-invoice netting.) Tj
T*
